Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:33.22,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:33.22,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}高芙 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}1 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(3){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 李吉妮 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,She managed to find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,她想办法找到了突破口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to regain control and wrap up the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,重新掌控局面 锁定胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.80,EN,,0,0,0,,straight sets, but not straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,直落两盘 但绝不轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,6-1, 7-6(3)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,6-1 7-6(3)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:14.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Then you flipped the switch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后你像换了个开关一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and changed things up and made sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,整个打法都变了 而且确保
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that you walked off the court today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天最后是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in straight sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,直落两盘走下场的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Tell us how you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I mean she started to play better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 她后来打得更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I had a couple break opportunities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有过几个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,在第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以就是尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to to forget those the ones that I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,把没把握住的那几个忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And honestly, it was really hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 今天真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:33.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to control the ball today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:33.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,控制住球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think we're both making a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们俩今天可能都
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of unforced errors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,犯了不少非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that maybe we both normally don't make,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,平时都不太会犯的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but it was my first time playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过这是我今年第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.16,EN,,0,0,0,,on center court this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这片中心球场打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:43.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So happy to be back here on this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,能回到这片场地上真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.16,EN,,0,0,0,,We love having you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也很高兴你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So often we see in women's tennis now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,女子网坛现在常常是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.60,EN,,0,0,0,,go big or go home, but you weren't afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,要么全力搏杀 要么什么都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to mix things up a little bit today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你今天不怕把打法变一变
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.72,EN,,0,0,0,,You got up to the net when you had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,该上网的时候你就上了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:52.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you happiest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场表现里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:53.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with about your performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最满意哪一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:54.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I think just staying mentally solid even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得是心态一直稳得住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.72,EN,,0,0,0,,if I wasn't, you know, feeling the ball
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕到第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:00:59.80,EN,,0,0,0,,so good towards the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:00:59.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,手感其实没那么好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.96,EN,,0,0,0,,But you know, also I had some doubles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我发球也出现了几个双误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.64,EN,,0,0,0,,on the serve, but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought I serve aggressively
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我发球还是打得很主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:07.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah, I think you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.60,EN,,0,0,0,,playing from a night match to the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,从夜场打到白天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.60,EN,,0,0,0,,it's so different, so just trying to adjust
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉完全不一样 我就是在适应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:11.40,EN,,0,0,0,,with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这种变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:13.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You said you weren't feeling the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说手感不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:15.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Were you feeling the love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,那有没有感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:17.24,EN,,0,0,0,,from everybody here in Cincinnati?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提这边的爱？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:18.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:18.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:21.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely impossible not to to feel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,根本不可能感受不到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:21.72,EN,,0,0,0,,the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这份爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:23.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, the lady
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,对了 那位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.72,EN,,0,0,0,,who started the chant and the tiebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在抢七带头喊口号的女士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I I enjoyed that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢那一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:27.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:28.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So, you noticed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:28.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,看来你注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:29.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Way to go. Through to the fourth round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,太棒了 晋级第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.80,0:01:31.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Coco Gauff, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.80,0:01:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙 掌声送给她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:33.22,EN,,0,0,0,,This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,太精彩了
